  <p>Pick a scenario and press Play. The plan view and the HSI show the same moment. The thick line is the course, the dotted lines either side mark the 10° where the bar is alive, and the diamond on the HSI is the ground-track marker. Switch the plan view to heading up and it turns the same way as the HSI.</p>
  <div class="buttons chips" data-scenes></div>
