  <p class="no-js">Interactive figure unavailable. On the 210 <Term id="Radial">radial</Term> with the inbound course 360 set, the bar is pinned right at full scale. Turn to 060 (the 30-degree method), and the bar comes alive within 10° of the course and centres as you roll out on 360.</p>
