  </div>
  <div class="fig-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Figure 2, scrolls sideways on narrow screens" tabindex="0"><svg class="natops" viewBox="0 0 640 310" role="img" aria-label="Quarter of a DME arc south-west of a station, the chords flown along it, the lead point to join it and the lead radial to leave it"></svg></div>
